<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id">RRK08.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">RUUSI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekitabo Kya Ruusi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ruusi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rus</para>
  <para style="mt2">EKITABO KYA</para>
  <para style="mt1">RUUSI</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="RUT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Elimeleki na Naomi okushuhuukira Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 2:16">Bar 2:16</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 12:10">Kut 12:10</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:1">26:1</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 18:2">1 Bag 18:2</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 8:1">2 Bag 8:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro by'okutegyeka kw'abaramuzi, hakabaho enjara omu nsi. Omushaija wa Betelehemu-Yuda yaashuhuukira omu nsi ya Moabu, we n'omukazi we n'abatabani bombi. <verse eid="RUT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 1:2" />Ogwo mushaija akaba naayetwa Elimeleki, n'omukazi we naayetwa Naomi, n'amaziina g'abatabani gakaba gari Mahalooni na Kilioni; bakaba bari aba Efuraata, aba Betelehemu-Yuda. Ku baahikire omu nsi ya Moabu, baatuurayo. <verse eid="RUT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 1:3" />Bwanyima Elimeleki iba wa Naomi yaafa; Naomi yaatsigara n'abatabani bombi. <verse eid="RUT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 1:4" />Baashwera Abamoabukazi, omwe akaba naayetwa Orupa, n'ondi Ruusi; baamarayo emyaka nka ikumi. <verse eid="RUT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 1:5" />Bwanyima Mahalooni na Kilioni bombi baafa; Naomi ogwo yaafeerwa iba n'abatabani bombi.<verse eid="RUT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruusi okwanga kutaana na nyinazaara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 1:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 4:31">Kur 4:31</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:7">Zef 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:68">Luk 1:68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:16">7:16</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 28:20">Kut 28:20</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:14">Zab 104:14</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 104:16">16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima yaimuka n'abakaamwana kugarukayo naaruga omu nsi ya Moabu; ahakuba akaba yaahuririire omu nsi ya Moabu, ku MUKAMA ataayaayiire abantu be, akabaha eby'okurya. <verse eid="RUT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 1:7" />Yaaruga ahu yaabaire ari hamwe n'abakaamwana bombi, baakwata omuhanda kugaruka omu nsi ya Yuda. <verse eid="RUT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 1:8" />Naomi yaagira abakaamwana ati: Mwirooko, buri omwe agarukye omu nju ya nyina. MUKAMA abakorere eby'embabazi, nk'oku mwabinkoreire na baanyakufa. <verse eid="RUT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 3:1">Rus 3:1</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA abahe obuhuumure, buri omwe omu ka ya iba. Yaabanywegyera, baimutsya amaraka, baarira. <verse eid="RUT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 1:10" />Baamugarukamu bati: Ngaaha, kureka nitwija kugarukayo naiwe omu bantu b'owaanyu. <verse eid="RUT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 38:11">Kut 38:11</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 25:5">Bir 25:5</ref>. </char></note> Naomi yaabagira ati: Baana bangye, mugarukyeyo; nimwendera ki kugyenda naanye? Nimugira ngu nkiine abandi baana omunda, ngu nyentsya babe abashaija baanyu? <verse eid="RUT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 1:12" />Baana bangye, mwegyendere, mugarukyeyo, ahakuba nkuzire, tinkiri w'okushwerwa. Nangwa n'obu naakugira nti, nyine amatsiko, nari n'obu naakushwerwa omushaija eki kiro, naazaara abaana b'aboojo, <verse eid="RUT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 19:21">Yob 19:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 32:4">Zab 32:4</ref>. </char></note> ebyo mukaabategyereza, okuhitsya ahu barikurira? Haza ekyo kibazibira kushwerwa? Ngaaha, baana bangye; ninshaasha munonga ahabwanyu, ahakuba MUKAMA abangire omukono gwe kundwanisa. <verse eid="RUT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:4">Bir 4:4</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 18:24">Enf 18:24</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:66-69">Yoh 6:66-69</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:39">Heb 10:39</ref>. </char></note> Baagaruka baimutsya amaraka gaabo, baarira. Orupa yaanywegyera nyinazaara, kwonka Ruusi we yaamubaho akaramata.<verse eid="RUT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 1:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 24:15-21">Yos 24:15-21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naomi yaamugira ati: Reeba, muka baro yaagaruka omuri beene waabo, n'ahari ruhanga we; naiwe garukayo, okurate muka baro. <verse eid="RUT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 1:16" />Ruusi yaamugarukamu ati: Reka kuunyeshengyereza kukutsigaho, n'obu kwakuba okugarukayo, ngu ndekye kukukuratira; ahakuba ahu oriza hoona, naanye niho ndiza; ahu oriraara, naanye niho ndiraara; abantu baawe nibo bariba abantu bangye, kandi Ruhanga waawe niwe ariba Ruhanga wangye. <verse eid="RUT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 1:17" />Ahu origwa, naanye niho ndigwa, kandi niho ndiziikwa. Ku harigira ekyantaanisa naiwe, kitari rufu, MUKAMA akinture n'okukiraho. <verse eid="RUT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 1:18" />Naomi ku yaareebire amaririire kimwe kugyenda nawe, yaarekyera aho kumugambira.<verse eid="RUT 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 1:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 21:10">Mat 21:10</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 2:15">Tonz 2:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Batyo baagumizamu bombi okuhitsya obu baahikire Betelehemu. Ku baahikireyo, ab'omu rurembo boona baajagarara ahabwabo, abakazi baabuuzana bati: Beitu ogu ni Naomi? <verse eid="RUT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 1:20" />Yaabagarukamu ati: Murekye kuunyeta <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Naomi, amakuru ngu Orikukundwa. </char></note>Naomi, kureka muunyete <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maara, amakuru ngu Obushaarizi. </char></note>Maara; ahabw'okuba Ow'obushoboorozi bwona akankorera ebirikushaarira munonga. <verse eid="RUT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 1:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:7">1 Sam 2:7</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 2:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 1:21">Yob 1:21</ref>. </char></note> Nkaruga kunu nyijwire, mbwenu MUKAMA yangarura ntaine kantu. Nimuunyetera ki Naomi, haza nimureeba oku MUKAMA ambonaboneise, kandi Ow'obushoboorozi bwona oku angwisiize akagwe.<verse eid="RUT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 1:22" />Okwo nikwo Naomi yaagarukire na Ruusi Omumoabukazi omukaamwana, nibaruga omu nsi ya Moabu. Baahika Betelehemu omu itogyera rya sayiri.<verse eid="RUT 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="RUT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ruusi okuhumba omu misiri ya Boazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="RUT 3:2">Rus 3:2</ref>, <ref loc="RUT 3:12">12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Naomi akaba aine omunyabuzaare ow'oruganda rwa iba, omushaija omutungi rugambwa, ow'omuryango gwa Elimeleki, eiziina rye Boazi. <verse eid="RUT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:22">Lev 23:22</ref>. </char></note> Ruusi Omumoabukazi yaagira Naomi ati: Ka nze omu misiri, mpumbe engano ninkuratira orangirire embabazi. Yaamugira ati: Irooko, mwana wangye. <verse eid="RUT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 2:3" />Yaagyenda, yaahika omu misiri, yaahumba akuratiire abarikugyesha; yaahika aha kicweka ky'emisiri ekyabaire kiri ekya Boazi, ow'omuryango gwa Elimeleki, kwonka atakimanyire. <verse eid="RUT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 129:7">Zab 129:7</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 129:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 3:16">2 Tes 3:16</ref>. </char></note> Kandi reeba, Boazi yaija naaruga Betelehemu, yaaramutsya abagyesi ati: MUKAMA agume naimwe. Nabo baamugarukamu bati: MUKAMA akuhe omugisha. <verse eid="RUT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 2:5" />Bwanyima Boazi yaabuuza omunyampara w'abagyesi ati: Omwishiki ogu n'ow'oha? <verse eid="RUT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 2:6" />Omunyampara ogwo yaagarukamu ati: N'omwishiki w'Omumoabu owaagarukire na Naomi okuruga omu nsi ya Moabu. <verse eid="RUT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 2:7" />Ku yaija, yangira ati: Ninkweshengyereza, nyikiriza mpumbe ninshanguruza nkuratiire abagyesi ahagati y'ebiba. Atyo yaija, yaiha omu kasheeshe naahumba n'okuhitsya hati, kureka akaanya kakye, aku yaahuumuraho omu nju.<verse eid="RUT 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 2:8" />Bwanyima Boazi yaagira Ruusi ati: Hurira, mwana wangye! Otaza kuhumba omu gundi musiri, kandi otaruga omuri ogu, kureka ogume haihi n'abazaana bangye. <verse eid="RUT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 2:9" />Ogume otaire amaisho aha musiri ogu barikugyesha, kandi obakuratire. Tiwaahurira ku naayehanangiriza abatsigazi, ngu hatagira owaakukoraho? Kandi ku oraagire eiriho, oze aha nyungu, onywe aha maizi agu abatsigazi baataha. <verse eid="RUT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 2:10" />Ruusi yaajuumara ahansi, yaamugira ati: N'enki ekyakureetera kungirira embabazi n'okuunyetaho, haza ndi omunyaihanga? <verse eid="RUT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 2:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 18:29">Luk 18:29</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 18:30">30</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:24-26">Heb 11:24-26</ref>. </char></note> Boazi yaamugarukamu ati: Banshobororeire gye byona ebi waakoreire nyokozaara okwiha obu baro yaafa, kandi n'oku waatsigireho sho na nyoko n'ensi yaanyu, okaija omu bantu abu waabaire otakamanyaga. <verse eid="RUT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 2:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 19:11">Zab 19:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 36:7">36:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:12">Mat 5:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:1">6:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:35">Luk 6:35</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA akuzimuurire ahabw'ebi waakozire; MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli; ou waahungiire omu mapapa ge, akuhe ebihembo byawe byona bitacwirweho. <verse eid="RUT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 2:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:3">Fil 2:3</ref>. </char></note> Ruusi yaagira ati: Mukama wangye, wangirira embabazi nyingi, ahabw'okuba wampuumuriza, kandi waagamba gye n'omuzaana waawe, n'obu ndaabe ntari nk'omwe aha bazaana baawe.<verse eid="RUT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 2:14" />Obunaku bw'okurya ku bwahikire, Boazi yaamugira ati: Ija aha, orye eby'okurya, okoze ekitongye kyawe omuri viinyo. Ruusi yaashutama aha rubaju rw'abagyesi; baamuha sayiri ekarangire, yaarya, yaahaaga, yaagitsigaho. <verse eid="RUT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 2:15" />Kandi ku yaimukire kugaruka kuhumba, Boazi yaaragiira abatsigazi be ati: Mumurekye ahumbe n'omu biba, mutamujuma. <verse eid="RUT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 2:16" />Kandi mumwihire ezindi omu biba, muzitsigye aho, azihumbe, mutamugambaho.<verse eid="RUT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 2:17" />Atyo yaahumba omuri ogwo musiri okuhitsya omu mwabazyo; bwanyima yaahuura ebi yaahumba, haarugamu <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">eefa neingana galloni munaana. </char></note>eefa ya sayiri. <verse eid="RUT 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 2:18" />Yaagyekorera, yaaza omu rurembo, nyinazaara yaareeba ei yaahumba; Ruusi yaiha omu kikondooro ebi yaatsigaza yaaheza kurya, yaabimuha. <verse eid="RUT 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 2:19" />Nyinazaara yaamubuuza ati: Waahumba hi eri izooba? Kandi waakora hi? Owaakwetaho aheebwe omugisha. Yaagambira nyinazaara mukama w'omusiri, ogu yaakoramu, yaamugira ati: Mukama w'omusiri ogu naakoramu eri izooba naayetwa Boazi. <verse eid="RUT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 2:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 3:10">Rus 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 1:16">2 Tim 1:16</ref>, <ref loc="2TI 1:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 17:17">Enf 17:17</ref>; <ref loc="RUT 3:9">Rus 3:9</ref>. </char></note> Naomi yaagira omukaamwana ati: Ogwo mushaija aheebwe omugisha ahari MUKAMA, otarekire kugirira mbabazi abakiriho na baanyakufa. Naomi yaagaruka yaamugira ati: Ogwo mushaija ni mwene waitu ow'obuzaare bwa haihi, omwe ah'abashemereire kutucungura. <verse eid="RUT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 2:21" />Ruusi Omumoabukazi yaamugira ati: N'ekya buzima yangira ati: Ogume haihi n'abairu bangye, okuhitsya obu baraaheze kugyesha emisiri yangye yoona. <verse eid="RUT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 2:22" />Naomi yaagira Ruusi omukaamwana ati: Mwana wangye, ni kirungi ogume ogyende n'abazaana be, barekye kukushanga omu gundi musiri. <verse eid="RUT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="RUT 2:23" />Okuruga obwo yaaguma haihi n'abazaana ba Boazi, naahumba okuhitsya aha muheru gw'eishaaruura rya sayiri n'engano; kandi yaaguma na nyinazaara.<verse eid="RUT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="RUT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ruusi okuza omu mbuga ya Boazi kumushaba obuhwezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="RUT 1:9">Rus 1:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Naomi nyinazaara yaagira Ruusi ati: Mwana wangye, tinshemereire kukusherurira amaka, okabona kuba gye? <verse eid="RUT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 2:8">Rus 2:8</ref>. </char></note> Boazi, ou obaire ori hamwe n'abazaana be, titwine nawe obuzaare? Reeba, eki kiro naaheheeza sayiri aha mbuga y'okuhuuriraho. <verse eid="RUT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 3:3" />N'ahabw'ekyo yoga, oyesiigye, ojware gye, oshuume aha mbuga y'okuhuuriraho; kwonka orekye kumwegambira, atakaherize kurya n'okunywa. <verse eid="RUT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 3:4" />Kandi ku araabyame, oyetegyereze ahu yaabyama, ogyende omushwekuure ebigyere, obyame; bwanyima naija kukugambira eki oraakore. <verse eid="RUT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 3:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:1">Efe 6:1</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:20">Kol 3:20</ref>. </char></note> Ruusi yaamugarukamu ati: Ebi waagamba byona naaza kubikora.<verse eid="RUT 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 3:6" />Yaashuuma yaaza aha mbuga, yaakora nk'oku nyinazaara yaamuragiira. <verse eid="RUT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 3:7" />Boazi ku yaaherize kurya n'okunywa, omutima gwe gwashemererwa, yaagyenda yaabyama aha rubaju rw'ekirundo ky'engano; Ruusi yaija naashooba, yaashwekuura ebigyere bye, yaabyama. <verse eid="RUT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 3:8" />Omu itumbi ogwo mushaija yaayekanga, yaahinduka, yaashanga omukazi abyami aha bigyere bye. <verse eid="RUT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:8">Ezk 16:8</ref>. </char></note> Yaamubuuza ati: Ori oha, iwe? Onu yaagarukamu ati: Ndi omuzaana waawe Ruusi; shweka omuzaana waawe ekijwaro kyawe; ahakuba niiwe waitu ow'okutucungura. <verse eid="RUT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 3:10" />Boazi yaagira ati: Mwana wangye, MUKAMA akuhe omugisha! Ebirungi ebi waayoreka hati nibikira ebi waayorekire ira, ahabw'okuba tosherwire batsigazi, yaaba booro nari abatungi. <verse eid="RUT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 3:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 31:10">Enf 31:10</ref>, <ref loc="PRO 31:29">29</ref>, <ref loc="PRO 31:31">31</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu mwana wangye, otatiina. Niinyija kukukorera ebi waagamba byona; ahabw'okuba bagyenzi bangye boona ab'omuri oru rurembo nibamanya ku ori omukazi w'omutima. <verse eid="RUT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 3:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 4:1">Rus 4:1</ref>. </char></note> N'ekya buzima kwo ndi oshemereire kubacungura; kwonka hariho ondiijo orikunkira kuba haihi. <verse eid="RUT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Bir 25:5</ref>; <ref loc="RUT 4:5">Rus 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 22:24">Mat 22:24</ref>. </char></note> Raara aha eki kiro; omu kasheeshe ku araikirize kukukorera ebi omunyabuzaare akora, ni kirungi; abikore; kwonka ku araayangye kubikukorera, nindahira MUKAMA otahwaho, niinyija kukukorera ebi omucunguzi w'obuzaare bwa haihi ashemereire kukora; mbwenu byama busheeshe.<verse eid="RUT 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 3:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 14:16">Rom 14:16</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 10:32">1 Kor 10:32</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:22">1 Tes 5:22</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:12">1 Pet 2:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaabyama aha bigyere bye, bwarugaho bwasheesha; yaimuka butakahwerize, ahu omuntu ateetegyerereza mugyenzi we; ahabw'okuba Boazi akagira ngu kirekye kumanywa ku ogwo mukazi aizire aha mbuga. <verse eid="RUT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 3:15" />Kandi yaamugira ati: Reeta ogwo munagiro gu ojwaire, ogutegye. Onu yaagumutega; yaamushukiraho encuro mukaaga za sayiri, yaazimukorera; Ruusi yaataaha omu rurembo. <verse eid="RUT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 3:16" />Ku yaahikire owa nyinazaara, nyinazaara yaamubuuza ati: Bigyenzire bita, mwana wangye? Ruusi yaamugambira ebi ogwo mushaija amukoreire byona. <verse eid="RUT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 3:17" />Kandi ati: Ezi ncuro mukaaga za sayiri niwe yaazimpa; ahakuba yangira ati: Otagaruka ahari nyokozaara engaro nsha. <verse eid="RUT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 3:18" />Naomi yaamugira ati: Yeshutamire, mwana wangye, okuhitsya ahu oraamanyire oku biraabe; ahabw'okuba ogwo mushaija tarikwija kuhuumura atakabiherize.<verse eid="RUT 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="RUT 4" />
  <para style="s1">Boazi okuhungura Ruusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="RUT 3:12">Rus 3:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Boazi yaaza aha irembo, yaashutama; kandi reeba, ogwo ow'obuzaare bwa haihi, ou Boazi yaagambireho, yaija naarabaho. Boazi yaamweta ati: Yeiwe! Ndabaho, oshutame aha kakye. Yaakiikama, yaashutama. <verse eid="RUT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 18:21">Kur 18:21</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 18:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:18">Bir 16:18</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 21:8">1 Bag 21:8</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 31:23">Enf 31:23</ref>. </char></note> Boazi yaareeta abashaija ikumi aha bakuru b'orwo rurembo, yaabagira ati: Mushutame aha! Baashutama. <verse eid="RUT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 4:3" />Yaagambira ogwo ow'obuzaare bwa haihi ati: Naomi ogarukire naaruga omu nsi ya Moabu, naatunda ekibanja ekyabaire kiri ekya mwene waitu Elimeleki; <verse eid="RUT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 4:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:7">Yer 32:7</ref>, <ref loc="JER 32:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 12:17">Rom 12:17</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 8:21">2 Kor 8:21</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 23:18">Kut 23:18</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 25:25">Lev 25:25</ref>. </char></note> mbwenu nteekateekire kukikugambira, nti: Okigurire omu maisho g'aba abari aha n'omu maisho g'abakuru b'oruganda rwaitu. Ku oraabe nooyenda kukicungura, okucungure; nari ku oraabe otarikwenda, nabwo ongambire, nkimanye; ahabw'okuba tihariho ondiijo ow'okukicungura kureka iwe, naanye orikukukurata. Onu yaagira ati: Niinyija kukicungura. <verse eid="RUT 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 4:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Bir 25:5</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 25:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="RUT 3:13">Rus 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 22:24">Mat 22:24</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Boazi yaagira ati: Eizooba eri oraagurireho ekyo kibanja na Naomi, omanye ku oshemereire kukigura n'ahari Ruusi Omumoabukazi, muka nyakufa, okugaruraho eiziina rya nyakufa omu buhunguzi bwe. <verse eid="RUT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 4:6" />Ogwo munyabuzaare bwa haihi yaagarukamu ati: Nyowe tindikubaasa kukicungura, ntakaashisha obuhunguzi bwangye. Okicungure omu mwanya gwangye, ahakuba tindikubaasa kukicungura.<verse eid="RUT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 4:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 25:7">Bir 25:7</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 25:9">9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi obunyakare ogu nigwo gwabaire guba omucwe omuri Israeli omu by'okucungura n'eby'okuhingisa; ku baabaire benda kuhamya eki baakora, omwe akaba ajuura enkaito, agiha mugyenzi we; okwo nikwo Abaisraeli baabaire bahamya endagaano. <verse eid="RUT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 4:8" />N'ahabw'ekyo ogwo munyabuzaare bwa haihi, ku yaagambiire Boazi ati: Okicungure, yaajuura enkaito ye. <verse eid="RUT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 4:9" />Bwanyima Boazi yaagambira abakuru n'abantu boona ati: Eri izooba muri baakareebi b'okuhamya ku naagura na Naomi byona ebyabaire biri ebya Elimeleki n'ebya Kilioni byona n'ebya Mahalooni byona. <verse eid="RUT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:6">Bir 25:6</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Ruusi Omumoabukazi owaabaire ari muka Mahalooni, nawe naamugura kuba omukazi wangye, mbone kugaruraho eiziina rya nyakufa omu buhunguzi bwe, eiziina rya nyakufa rirekye kweba omuri beene waabo n'omu irembo ry'eka ye. Muri baakareebi eri izooba. <verse eid="RUT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 4:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 127:3">Zab 127:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 128:3">128:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 35:16">Kut 35:16</ref>. </char></note> Abantu boona abaabaire bari omu irembo n'abakuru baagira bati: Turi baakareebi. Ogu mukazi owaaza omu nju yaawe MUKAMA amugire nka Rakeeli na Lea oku baakwataniise bombi kwimutsya enju ya Israeli; naiwe okore ebishemeire omuri Efuraata, kandi orangaanwe omuri Betelehemu, <verse eid="RUT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 4:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 38:20">Kut 38:20</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 2:4">1 Bus 2:4</ref>. </char></note> kandi enju yaawe ebe nk'eya Pereezi, ou Tamari yaazaariire Yuda, ahabw'abaana abu MUKAMA arikuha omuri ogwo mukazi muto.<verse eid="RUT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruusi okuzaara Obedi ishenkuru wa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 4:13" />Atyo Boazi yaatwara Ruusi, yaaba omukazi we; yaamuta aha mukono, MUKAMA yaamuha enda, yaazaara omwana w'omwojo. <verse eid="RUT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 4:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:58">Luk 1:58</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 12:15">Rom 12:15</ref>. </char></note> Abakazi baagira Naomi bati: MUKAMA asiimwe ahabw'okutakureka otaine w'obuzaare bwa haihi; kandi eiziina rye rirangaanwe omuri Israeli. <verse eid="RUT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 4:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 1:8">1 Sam 1:8</ref>. </char></note> Aryaba ow'okukugaruramu amagara, kandi ow'okukuriisa omu bukaikuru bwawe; ahabw'okuba mukaamwana waawe, orikukukunda, kandi orikukukirira abaana b'aboojo mushanju, niwe amuzaire. <verse eid="RUT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 4:16" />Naomi yaakwata omwana, yaamukiikira, yaaba omurezi we. <verse eid="RUT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 4:17" />Kandi abakazi bataahi be baamweta eiziina, nibagira bati: Omwana w'omwojo azaariirwe Naomi. Baamweta Obedi; niwe ishe wa Yese, ishe wa Daudi.<verse eid="RUT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 4:18" />Kandi oru nirwo ruzaaro rwa Pereezi; Pereezi akazaara Hezirooni, <verse eid="RUT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 4:19" />Hezirooni yaazaara Raamu; Raamu yaazaara Aminadabu; <verse eid="RUT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 4:20" />Aminadabu yaazaara Nahashooni; Nahashooni yaazaara Salumooni; <verse eid="RUT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 4:21" />Salumooni yaazaara Boazi; Boazi yaazaara Obedi; <verse eid="RUT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 4:22" />Obedi yaazaara Yese, na Yese yaazaara Daudi.<verse eid="RUT 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 4" />
</usx>